# backslash-comment-mid: Does a backslash in the middle of a # comment drop the rest of the comment and swallow the next line (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: v@3=2
# pc: ODE0076
# ruling: the first backslash ends the comment text and joins the next line, wherever it stands in the comment (language.md, Lines).
# a path like a\b in a comment
x'=1
x'=2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
